## Check 2: after the move to the new DNS host

Changed since check 1: NS, MX and CAA on acme.test; shop.acme.test renewed by the second CA;
api.acme.test answers 127.0.0.9 once; the resolver drops the MX question for www.acme.test.
$ bareproxy drift -c /work/drift.conf
